cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Qwen-VL Batch Captioner for Runpod Serverless
message: If you use this worker, please cite it and upstream Qwen3-VL.
type: software
authors:
  - name: prilojject
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/prilojject/runpod-qwen-vl-caption
url: https://prilojject.github.io/runpod-qwen-vl-caption/
abstract: >-
  A Runpod Serverless worker that batch-captions images for LoRA / diffusion
  datasets with official Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct (bf16, sidecar .txt + captions.json),
  with optional short VQA.
keywords:
  - qwen3-vl
  - image-captioning
  - lora
  - runpod
  - serverless
  - vqa
references:
  - type: software
    title: Qwen3-VL
    authors:
      - name: Qwen Team
      - name: Alibaba Cloud
    repository-code: https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL
    license: Apache-2.0
  - type: software
    title: Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct
    authors:
      - name: Qwen Team
    url: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct
    notes: Licensed under Apache-2.0 according to the Hugging Face model card.
